    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Swag</strong>\u00a0is a cooperative horror shooter that plunges you into the heart of the Zone. Navigate eerie forests, anomaly-ridden fields, and abandoned villages on the surface, while delving into dark underground bunkers, laboratories, and industrial ruins filled with deadly secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with fellow stalkers to survive in this unforgiving world. Explore the Zone, evade lethal anomalies, fight terrifying mutants, and uncover rare artifacts. Sell your findings to a mysterious trader to upgrade your gear and prepare for even more dangerous expeditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Survival:</strong>\u00a0Join forces with friends to survive in a world where every mistake can be your last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Worlds of the Zone:</strong>\u00a0Explore perilous surface areas and dive into foreboding underground locations brimming with hidden dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tension-Filled Atmosphere:</strong>\u00a0Every mission will keep you on edge\u2014mutants, anomalies, and constant challenges ensure a relentless experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifact Collection and Trade:</strong>\u00a0Venture into the Zone driven by greed and return with the hope of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactics and Teamwork:</strong>\u00a0Coordinate your actions to overcome the Zone's many threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face the horrors of the Zone? Explore, fight, survive, and prove you have what it takes to be a stalker. Welcome to\u00a0<strong>Deadly Swag</strong>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Swag</strong>\u00a0is a cooperative horror shooter that plunges you into the heart of the Zone. Navigate eerie forests, anomaly-ridden fields, and abandoned villages on the surface, while delving into dark underground bunkers, laboratories, and industrial ruins filled with deadly secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with fellow stalkers to survive in this unforgiving world. Explore the Zone, evade lethal anomalies, fight terrifying mutants, and uncover rare artifacts. Sell your findings to a mysterious trader to upgrade your gear and prepare for even more dangerous expeditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Survival:</strong>\u00a0Join forces with friends to survive in a world where every mistake can be your last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Worlds of the Zone:</strong>\u00a0Explore perilous surface areas and dive into foreboding underground locations brimming with hidden dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tension-Filled Atmosphere:</strong>\u00a0Every mission will keep you on edge\u2014mutants, anomalies, and constant challenges ensure a relentless experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifact Collection and Trade:</strong>\u00a0Venture into the Zone driven by greed and return with the hope of survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactics and Teamwork:</strong>\u00a0Coordinate your actions to overcome the Zone's many threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face the horrors of the Zone? Explore, fight, survive, and prove you have what it takes to be a stalker. Welcome to\u00a0<strong>Deadly Swag</strong>!</p>",
